## 🔍 What Happens Behind the Scenes?

When I run:

```bash
kubectl get nodes
```

the simplified process is:

```text
Terminal
   │
   ▼
kubectl
   │
   ▼
API Server
   │
   ▼
Kubernetes Cluster
   │
   ▼
Node Information
   │
   ▼
Terminal
```

`kubectl` sends a request to the Kubernetes API Server.

The API Server processes the request and returns the information.

