# 📊 Why Kubernetes is Useful

| Requirement            | Kubernetes Capability          |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Application deployment | Workload management            |
| Application scaling    | Horizontal scaling             |
| Failed containers      | Self-healing mechanisms        |
| Application networking | Service discovery & networking |
| Application updates    | Rollouts & rollbacks           |
| Configuration          | ConfigMaps & Secrets           |
| Storage                | Storage orchestration          |

These are among the capabilities provided by Kubernetes.

